Package: trendkernel
Type: Package
Title: Single-Pass Theil-Sen + Mann-Kendall Kernel
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Atlas", "Pipeline", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "p.steward@cgiar.org")
Description: Rcpp single-pass Sen slope + Mann-Kendall p-value kernel (mk_sen_cpp)
    and lag-1 autocorrelation (lag1_ac_cpp) for R/2.1 section 3.4 trend computation.
    Packaged so parallel (future) workers load it via library() — robust under
    multisession (no sourceCpp-into-shared-env, no external-pointer serialisation).
